  "title": "add-param-count-attribute-to-otel-span",
  "request": "Can we record how many request parameters were sent? I'd like the OpenTelemetry span to include a "mcp.method.params.count" attribute showing the number of top‑level params for each request.",
  "edits": [
    {
      "path": "src/mcp/server/_otel.py",
